{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】油麻地一間便利店凌晨被賊人行劫，無人受傷。</p><p>警員封鎖現場調查。凌晨4時許，一名男子手持硬物，闖入佐敦道9號一間便利店指嚇職員，搶走現金後逃去。事件中無人受傷，警方正追緝疑犯下落。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T23:38:41.697917+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T23:09:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T11:38:05.881718+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T23:37:34.999779+00:00","content_hash":"5df6bc32b1a97d7a1d5d00218e231c857534ece6fc94ed2b725465bd63181e48","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}